      "message": "Harden TOTP authentication and enrollment\n\n- persist pending authentication and signup flows across page reloads\n- prevent immediate TOTP replay and strengthen secret generation\n- handle clock drift and multi-code verification correctly\n- normalize usernames and tighten request validation\n- rotate sessions after password authentication\n- simplify authentication, CSRF, and error-handling code\n- prevent duplicate form submissions and improve form feedback\n- add the missing loading-bar interceptor\n- migrate the database and regenerate jOOQ sources\n- expand controller and TOTP test coverage\n"
