      "message": "Enhance TOTP implementation and update project documentation\n\n- Updated README.md to reflect project structure and requirements.\n- Upgraded dependencies in package.json for PrimeNG and TypeScript ESLint.\n- Modified proxy configuration to include CSRF endpoint.\n- Refactored AuthService to include CSRF token handling for authentication requests.\n- Updated SignupController to normalize usernames and handle exceptions.\n- Improved CustomTotp class with code validation logic.\n- Added unit tests for invalid TOTP code handling.\n"
